=== narrow ===

 run the linter, write the big file,
 then copy the readme over the host's
 hosts file


$ ju… ✗ 1m11s 1h01m 5L ~100t 1144M exit…
$ dd if=/dev/… ✗ 2s 4L 8M exit(153): dd…
$ cp README… ✗ 6L ~100t 2M exit(1): cp:…

The linter was killed for its processor
time, the write for its size, and the
copy refused.
