=== wide ===

 run the linter, write the big file, then copy the readme over the host's hosts file


$ just lint ✗ 1m11s 1h01m 5L ~100t 1144M exit(137): error: recipe `lint` was terminated on line 104…
$ dd if=/dev/zero of=big bs=1M count=4096 ✗ 2s 4L 8M exit(153): dd: writing 'big': File size limit …
$ cp README.md /etc/hosts ✗ 6L ~100t 2M exit(1): cp: cannot create regular file '/etc/hosts': Permi…

